\pard\li1440\b stored properties \b0  \par
\pard\li2160 il y a en pure Qt des systeme de sauvegarde et de scripting des propri\'e9t\'e9s, mais qui est apperament ignor\'e9 par biding python .\par
\par
\pard\li2160\tx2160 PyQt4.QtCore.pyqtProperty(type[, fget=None[, fset=None[, freset=None[, fdel=None[, doc=None[, designable=True[, scriptable=True[, stored=True[, user=False[, constant=False[, final=False[, notify=None]]]]]]]]]]]])\'b6   \par
Create a property that behaves as both a Python property and a Qt property.\par
Parameters:\par
type\tab\tab the type of the property. It is either a Python type object or a string that is the name of a C++ type.\par
fget\tab\tab the optional callable used to get the value of the property.\par
fset\tab\tab the optional callable used to set the value of the property.\par
freset\tab\tab the optional callable used to reset the value of the property to its default value. It is ignored by Python\par
fdel\tab\tab the optional callable used to delete the property. It is ignored by Qt.\par
doc\tab\tab the optional docstring of the property. It is ignored by Qt.\par
designable\tab optionally sets the Qt DESIGNABLE flag. It is ignored by Python\par
\cf2\b scriptable\tab optionally sets the Qt SCRIPTABLE flag. It is ignored by Python\par
stored\tab\tab optionally sets the Qt STORED flag. It is ignored by Python\cf0\par
\b0 user\tab\tab optionally sets the Qt USER flag. It is ignored by Python\par
constant\tab optionally sets the Qt CONSTANT flag. It is ignored by Python\par
final\tab\tab optionally sets the Qt FINAL flag. It is ignored by Python\par
\pard\li2160 notify\tab\tab the optional unbound notify signal. It is ignored by Python\par
